"Why cross-reference against impounds?"

Good question. So when we miss a retrieval deadline at an impound lot and they sell the vehicle, that same loss can pop up as an unsolicited lien delete report in our system. Without cross-referencing, we'd be counting it twice—once as an impound loss, once as an individual loss. 

I found X overlaps like that and pulled them from the individual count since we'd already captured them on the impound side. Just making sure we're not inflating the numbers.

