"How did you match accounts across the datasets?"

I matched on either Account Number or VIN—whichever one hit. Used OR logic because sometimes the account number lines up, sometimes only the VIN matches depending on how the data's structured. That way I caught all the overlaps regardless of which identifier was consistent across systems.

